# modules/auto_recording.py -- NO LONGER EXCLUDED (register N114).
# README.md:64 advertises "Video / Live Recording -- Webcam / MP4 with
# automated fly counting", and app.py's PAGES has a Live Recording entry,
# but this file was excluded here -- so the shipped page could only ever
# tell a cloner to "Place auto_recording.py in modules/ folder", a file the
# repository did not contain. It also silently defeated two safeguards: the
# N6 background-subtractor regression guard recorded its own ImportError as
# a PASS, and validate_app_pages reported ALL APP PAGES RENDER for a page
# with zero widgets. The file is 355 lines with no author paths and a
# guarded cv2 import; it sat in this block beside *_bak.py and
# app_fixed_tabs.py and was evidently swept up with the dead files.
modules/camera_manager.py
modules/page_video_analyzer.py
