# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UNPUBLISHED LABORATORY RESULTS — deliberately NOT published to this public
# repository. The tool is here; the laboratory's own experimental results stay
# local until they are published. Added 2026-10-28.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Analysis outputs: per-fly data, contrast tables, figures of unpublished runs
