# Audit documents that QUOTE the unpublished recordings. The findings are the
# deliverable, but these two name the genotype and the compound and reproduce
# measured sleep values from `docs/DAM_RESULTS_REPORT.md` (register N62, N64,
# N65; plan section 4), so they stay local alongside that report until the
# results are published or the documents are generalised. The other four audit
# documents -- REPOSITORY_AUDIT, MODULE_INVENTORY, ARCHITECTURE_PROPOSAL and
# SCIENTIFIC_VALIDATION_PLAN -- carry no laboratory measurement and are public.
docs/BUG_AND_RISK_REGISTER.md
docs/PRIORITISED_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md

# Node dependencies for the document builder
node_modules/

# Cached activity/structure profiles derived from unpublished lab recordings.
# One decode pass per video is the whole cost of the cylinder-count study, so
# the profiles are cached -- but they are derived from footage that may not be
# published, so they never enter the repository.
.cache/
